THIRD-PARTY COMPONENTS
----------------------

1. drivers/hwmon/bcm59111.c

   Derived from the PoE driver contained in Cisco Meraki's GPL firmware
   release for the MX64/MX65:
   https://dl.meraki.net/wired-14-39-mx64-20190426.tar.bz2

   Original driver copyright: Timothy Passaro and Cisco Systems, Inc.
   Modifications for device-tree support and modern kernel APIs by
   Matthew Hagan, Matthew Bilker, Dimma Don't, and the contributors of
   this project.

   Licensed under GPL-2.0, consistent with the Cisco release.

   The PSE firmware blob (bcm59111.bin) is likewise extracted from that
   Cisco GPL firmware release.

2. OpenWrt build system

   Copyright (C) 2012-2026 OpenWrt project
   Licensed under GPL-2.0

3. U-Boot for the MX65 (not included here; obtained separately)

   https://github.com/clayface/U-boot-MX64-20190430_MX65
   Licensed under GPL-2.0


